{
 "_doc": "Three holidays of the town's own calendar (docs/festivals.md \"Science Day, the Old New Year, Neptune Day\"): what the hero does at them. Six things get an act like their old one plus a hands-on scene (\"proc\") that plays only on the holiday, in its hours: the fair's lottery table (the blitz quiz) and glass globe (the electric globe) on Science Day; the dumpling bar W1-U17's rolling board (dumplings with a surprise) and pot (the wax fortune) on the Old New Year; lifeguard tower 1's rope (the tug of war) and the rental W1-U15's pump (the inner-tube race) on Neptune Day. Staff talk topics of the day (given by rules, so they sit on those counters only) at the fair's coffee and snack kiosks, the dumpling bar, the lifeguards' tea flask and the rental; three of them are the day's food. The collection nh_calendar (nine stamps, three a holiday) and its reward. The quests nh_science_day, nh_old_new_year and nh_neptune_day are hand-written in Content/UI/quests.json (they wait for festival events and stamps). Words: strings/x_holidays.json (city.nh.*).",
